From: WellNest QA <qa@example.invalid>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 16:54:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix M4 test-log bugs B01, B02, B04, B05

- B01: Continue no longer silently disabled for short usernames; inline 3-20 rule shown and turns red when invalid, toast explains on Continue
- B02: Home 'Coming up' lists only future bookings (past seed/old bookings no longer shown)
- B04: Show a clear message when Google sign-in returns an error (e.g. provider not enabled) instead of silently reloading
- B05: Consent checkboxes no longer shrink next to long labels (shrink-0)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01R9W76y21Z4Ay2T6kkdwJ46
